&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Riskified empowers businesses to unleash ecommerce growth by taking risk off the table. Many of the world’s biggest brands and publicly traded companies selling online rely on Riskified for guaranteed protection against chargebacks, to fight fraud and policy abuse at scale, and to improve customer retention. Developed and managed by the largest team of ecommerce risk analysts, data scientists and researchers, Riskified’s AI-powered fraud and risk intelligence platform analyzes the individual behind each interaction to provide real-time decisions and robust identity-based insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Riskified is proud to work with incredible companies in virtually all industries including Booking.com, Acer, Gucci, Lorna Jane, GoPro, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.riskified.com/customers/&quot;&gt;many more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive in a collaborative work setting, alongside great people, to build and enhance products that matter. Abundant opportunities to create and contribute provide us with a sense of purpose that extends beyond ourselves, leaving a lasting impact. These sentiments capture why we choose Riskified every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We seek a highly motivated, organized, dedicated, and independent Bookkeeper to join our Finance team. As a Bookkeeper, you will support the team with daily accounting tasks, including processing and paying vendor invoices, supporting month-end closing activities, and more. The Finance team is responsible for all aspects of the company’s financial operations, ensuring compliance with tax regulations and business obligations while maintaining accurate and efficient financial processes. &lt;strong&gt;This is a temporary and full-time position (maternity leave replacement).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the bookkeeping team in all daily accounting tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and book vendors&#39; invoices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assemble information for external auditors for the annual audit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assure compliance with local, state, and federal government reporting requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain all tax withholdings for supplier invoices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with month-end closing as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bank reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing accruals and prepaid expenses on a monthly basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Official certification as a Bookkeeper&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience as a Bookkeeper&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in high-tech companies (advantage)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Netsuite (advantage)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English at an advanced level (both spoken and written) MUST&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and ability to multitask&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Riskified&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are a fast-growing and dynamic tech company with 750+ team members globally. We value collaboration and innovative thinking. We’re looking for bright, driven, and passionate people to grow with us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Tel-Aviv team is currently working in a hybrid of remote and in-office work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We have recently moved to our new space in Tel Aviv - check it out &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/UZWmHG0ouEE&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Some of our Tel Aviv Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commuter and parking benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Team events, fully-stocked kitchen,lunch stipend, happy hours, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;oga, pilates, functional training, basketball, soccer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Wide-ranging opportunities to volunteer and make an impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commitment to your professional development with global onboarding, s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;kills-based courses, lunch &amp;amp; learns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Awesome Riskified gifts and swag!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In the News&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.geektime.co.il/riskified-completes-nyse-ipo-valued-at-3-3b/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Geektime: Riskified Goes Public&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://finance.walla.co.il/item/3493929&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Walla!: Happy Hour at the Riskified Offices &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://insider.geektime.co.il/company/riskified/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Geektime Insider: A look at Riskified Tel Aviv&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globes.co.il/news/article.aspx?did=1001403322&quot;&gt;Globes: Riskified to contribute the highest amount up to date to Tmura&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://en.globes.co.il/en/article-globes-and-statista-present-israels-fastest-growing-companies-1001394530&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Globes: Riskified is among Israel’s fastest growing companies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2018/06/19/riskified-prevents-fraud-on-your-favorite-e-commerce-site/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;TechCrunch: Riskified Prevents Fraud on Your Fa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;vorite E-commerce Site&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Riskified is deeply committed to the principle of equal opportunity for all individuals. We do not discriminate based on race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability, veteran status, or any other status protected by law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Riskified empowers businesses to unleash ecommerce growth by taking risk off the table. Many of the world’s biggest brands and publicly traded companies selling online rely on Riskified for guaranteed protection against chargebacks, to fight fraud and policy abuse at scale, and to improve customer retention. Developed and managed by the largest team of ecommerce risk analysts, data scientists and researchers, Riskified’s AI-powered fraud and risk intelligence platform analyzes the individual behind each interaction to provide real-time decisions and robust identity-based insights. Riskified is proud to work with incredible companies in virtually all industries including Acer, Gucci, Lorna Jane, GoPro, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.riskified.com/customers/&quot;&gt;many more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive in a collaborative work setting, alongside great people, to build and enhance products that matter. Abundant opportunities to create and contribute provide us with a sense of purpose that extends beyond ourselves, leaving a lasting impact. These sentiments capture why we choose Riskified every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Riskified is hiring a Corporate &amp;amp; Securities Counsel to join our team of 6 attorneys. Reporting to the Director, Legal, you will be a key member of the corporate legal function—owning critical work streams across SEC reporting, corporate governance, and regulatory compliance. This is an exciting opportunity to join a successful public tech company and serve as a trusted advisor to senior leadership as they navigate complex strategic decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Israeli-founded company dual-listed on the NYSE, Riskified’s legal needs are genuinely global and multi-faceted—you will work across U.S. securities law, Israeli Companies Law, and international entity management. There is meaningful opportunity to expand into commercial contracts, privacy, and other substantive areas depending on your skills and interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a highly motivated attorney who wants to make a significant impact, works well independently, and thrives in a fast-moving, cross-functional environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A key member of Riskified’s corporate legal function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely as part of a cross-functional team on Exchange Act filings and other public disclosure documents, including preparation of earnings releases, 10-Ks / 20-Fs, 10-Qs, 8-Ks / 6-Ks, Proxy Statements, Section 16 Filings and other SEC-related documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with planning and preparation for board and committee meetings, and annual shareholder meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted business advisor to the General Counsel, CEO, CFO and other key individuals in the company on corporate, regulatory, strategy, international and employee equity matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain corporate compliance programs throughout the company, as well as developing educational materials for employees and executives on securities law, insider trading, and related topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide legal support on compliance with applicable laws and on establishing and maintaining foreign entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively anticipate legal issues that could impact the company and bring practical, risk-based recommendations to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide counsel on corporate transactions, including securities offerings, financings, investments, acquisitions and divestitures and other strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to expand into other legal substantive areas depending on skills and interests, including commercial contracts, bankruptcy, insurance, real estate and privacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JD Required. Member of the New York or other U.S. state Bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 to 3+ years of relevant experience at a top-tier law firm, ideally with a background in securities laws, public company disclosure, corporate governance and / or M&amp;amp;A.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience drafting and reviewing Exchange Act filings (10-Q, 10-K, 8-K, 20-F, 6-K etc.) and advising on executive compensation and benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with the Israel Companies Law is helpful but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical drafting skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills, flexibility and responsiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and can communicate clearly with both legal and non-legal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical mindset towards protecting the company from risks while enabling fast paced growth and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize tasks and manage time effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently while having good judgment to escalate significant matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fintech and/or SaaS experience is helpful but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this position is $175,000-$190,000. This range is applicable to candidates who will perform the job either wholly, or in part, within New York City. Actual salary will be based on qualifications, competencies, and location. If you feel this range is not attractive, we encourage you to let us know through the application process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary is just one part of the pay package at Riskified. All full-time regular employees receive a bonus target and are eligible to receive stock-based awards. Also, our value proposition goes way beyond compensation: our perks and benefits package, culture, community, and learning and development programs are just some of the elements we provide to bring value to our employees. We invite you to apply at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.riskified.com&quot;&gt;www.riskified.com&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about what we have to offer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Life at Riskified&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are a fast-growing and dynamic tech company with 750+ team members globally. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We value collaboration and innovative thinking. We’re looking for bright, driven, and passionate people to grow with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Some of our NYC Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Our NYC team is currently working in a hybrid of remote and in-office for all our team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fully-covered medical, dental, and vision insurance from your first day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Equity for all employees, 401(k) + matching, commuter benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunch, fully-stocked kitchen, team events, happy hours, birthday celebrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Yoga, pilates, soccer league, wellness classes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Wide-ranging opportunities to volunteer and make an impact in local communities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commitment to your professional development with global onboarding, sales bootcamp, s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;kills-based courses, full access to Udemy, lunch &amp;amp; learns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Awesome Riskified gifts and swag!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In the News&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.reuters.com/technology/general-atlantic-backed-riskified-valued-43-bln-nyse-debut-2021-07-29/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reuters: General Atlantic-backed Riskified valued at $4.3 bln in NYSE debut&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.com/best-workplaces/new-york/2022?category=small-and-medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fortune Magazine: Riskified named Best Workplaces in New York for 2022&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.themuse.com/advice/sales-enablement-manager-riskified-benedikt-parstorfer&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Muse: Q&amp;amp;A with Sales Enablement Manager Benedikt Parstorfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
