&lt;li&gt;A strong growth mindset and eagerness to learn new technologies and approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of Kubernetes fundamentals, with a focus on securing containerized applications and ensuring the security of Kubernetes clusters and workloads (optional, but a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
