&lt;p&gt;Riskified is hiring an Enterprise Account Executive to lead complex sales engagements with large eCommerce brands.&lt;br&gt;This is a strategic closing role within a team-based enterprise motion. You’ll partner with a dedicated Business Development team that supports prospect sourcing and early qualification, allowing you to focus on executive discovery, solution alignment, and closing.&lt;br&gt;You’ll work with senior leaders across Risk, Payments, Finance, and eCommerce to position Riskified as a long-term strategic partner.&lt;/p&gt;
