&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a passionate and data-driven Recruiter to join our global Recruitment team in Lisbon. This is a hybrid role based in Lisbon. If you thrive in a fast-paced, international environment and enjoy partnering with stakeholders to build exceptional teams, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Recruiter, you will own the full recruitment lifecycle, partnering closely with hiring managers, HR Business Partners, and cross-functional teams to attract and hire top talent across multiple business functions. You&#39;ll play a key role in delivering an outstanding candidate experience while helping scale our global organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the end-to-end recruitment process, including sourcing, screening, interview coordination, interviewing, offer management, and closing candidates, while ensuring a seamless and positive experience for both candidates and interview teams throughout the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with hiring managers and HR Business Partners to understand hiring needs and develop effective recruitment strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver an exceptional candidate experience through clear communication, transparency, and professionalism throughout the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-powered recruiting tools and automation to improve sourcing, candidate engagement, and overall recruitment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage recruitment processes across Portugal while collaborating with stakeholders across different regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build proactive talent pipelines using sourcing strategies, LinkedIn Recruiter, referrals, and other recruitment channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use recruitment KPIs and analytics to monitor pipeline health, identify bottlenecks, and continuously improve hiring performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure recruitment processes align with local labor regulations and company hiring standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employer branding initiatives and contribute to continuous improvement of recruitment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6+ years of experience in end-to-end, in-house recruitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring across multiple functions, including Tech, GTM and business roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a global environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sourcing skills, including experience with LinkedIn Recruiter and other sourcing tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI tools to enhance recruitment workflows and improve hiring outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with the ability to use data to drive recruitment decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and relationship-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, organized, and able to manage multiple hiring processes simultaneously in a dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or fluent Portuguese and English, with excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We include transparent salary ranges to support fairness, clarity, and informed decision-making early in the process. The base salary range for this position is €39,000 - €44,000 gross annually for candidates based in Lisbon. Your actual salary will be determined based on your unique skills, experience, and competencies. If your expectations differ, please let us know - we’re always open to a conversation.&lt;br&gt;The base salary is one part of the total compensation package at Riskified. All full-time regular employees receive a bonus target and are eligible to receive stock-based awards. Also, our value proposition goes way beyond compensation: our perks and benefits package, culture, community, and learning and development programs are just some of the elements we provide to bring value to our employees.&lt;/p&gt;
