&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End ML Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, train, evaluate, and optimize scalable predictive models (classification, regression, clustering, deep learning) for complex business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Feature Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Clean, transform, and extract high-value features from large-scale structured and unstructured data to continuously boost model performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Production:&lt;/strong&gt; Work within the Data Science team and alongside Data Engineers, Developers, and Product Managers to deploy models into production and translate complex insights into clear business actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; GenAI:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously explore emerging ML techniques, state-of-the-art tools, and GenAI workflows to elevate the team&#39;s analytical capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
