&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+ years of product management experience&lt;/strong&gt; in a technical, data-driven, or platform domain within global SaaS companies, ideally in &lt;strong&gt;Fintech, eCommerce&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;fraud/risk-related&lt;/strong&gt; businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building &lt;strong&gt;orchestration, workflow management and robust rules and decisioning solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to define and deliver complex, end-to-end product flows from ideation through general availability and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong UX and product sense&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience building intuitive solutions for complex problem spaces (beyond UI ownership alone).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success working in highly cross-functional environments with Engineering, Product Design, Data, and commercial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with GTM and Account Management teams to drive adoption, customer value, and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, prioritization, and execution skills in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong ability to interpret and leverage data to drive product decisions, ensuring alignment with business goals and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt; with an ability to translate data into actionable insights that drive product growth and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to clearly articulate complex technical and analytical concepts to diverse audiences, alongside experienced presenting to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Industrial Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
