&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Office and Facilities Manager to join our Global Workplace Operations team. We are committed to providing a positive and productive work environment for our employees. In this role, you will handle all office and facilities management, workplace planning and utilization, security, vendor management and budget oversight. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in office management and facilities management, ensuring the smooth operation of our office spaces and contributing to the overall success of our organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee office operations, maintenance and office look and feel ensuring a smooth and efficient workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule meeting rooms for employees and clients as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct daily floor walkthroughs, ensuring office space is up to standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with space planning and utilization, ensuring efficient use of office space and resources and performing space audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing vendors, tenants, landlord relationships, and agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with external vendors and service providers to ensure timely and effective delivery of facility-related services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate end-to-end logistics, accommodation arrangements, and itinerary schedules for NYC personnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own food and beverage delivery services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage office relocations, renovations, and other improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Main point of contact for subtenants, handling landlord relationships, and agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obtain competitive bids for services, ensuring cost-effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve problems quickly and efficiently for general office inquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the development and management of the office budget, monitoring expenses and identifying opportunities for cost savings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular financial reports and updates to management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal office communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing travel arrangements of individuals and groups, including flights, accommodation and ground transportation, checking for Travel Policy compliance, requesting budget approval when needed, and handling any other travel-related tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide high-level Executive Assistant support to senior leadership, including complex calendar management, meeting coordination, travel planning, expense reporting, preparation of presentations and documents, handling confidential information, and serving as a trusted point of contact to ensure smooth day-to-day executive operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 3-5+ years of experience in related positions preferably in a tech start-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work 5 days/week in our office in Flatiron&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a successful track record of supporting office management, security, and building compliance measures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient knowledge of building systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to handle multiple projects and competing priorities and adapt to a fluid, high-growth environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity in lease operations language and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in relevant software, such as facility management systems and Google Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this position is $90,000 - $105,000. This range is applicable to candidates who will perform the job either wholly, or in part, within New York City. Actual salary will be based on qualifications, competencies, and location. If you feel this range is not attractive, we encourage you to let us know through the application process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary is just one part of the pay package at Riskified. All full-time regular employees receive a bonus target and are eligible to receive stock-based awards. Also, our value proposition goes way beyond compensation: our perks and benefits package, culture, community, and learning and development programs are just some of the elements we provide to bring value to our employees. We invite you to apply at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.riskified.com&quot;&gt;www.riskified.com&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about what we have to offer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
