&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a Product Manager working with complex data &amp;amp; analytics solutions - must!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with operational teams as users in an analytics-based B2B product - must !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to envision, work with product designers and run the development of a complex system UI, with a knack for intuitive UX&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast learner with strong interpersonal and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI based products and technologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. in Computer Science or relevant Degree&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring fellow product managers - an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SaaS companies in a B2B setting - an advantage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with eCommerce, FinTech, Online Payments, Fraud - an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
