&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Global Revenue Enablement Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to own end-to-end enablement for our US Go-To-Market (GTM) teams. In this role, you’ll be the primary enablement partner for our Business Development (BD), Account Executive (AE), and Account Management (AM) teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll focus on the core of what makes enablement work: &lt;strong&gt;building strong relationships with sales leaders, designing engaging training programs, and delivering practical, high-impact facilitation.&lt;/strong&gt; If you love being in front of a room (or screen), coaching reps to succeed, and helping teams adopt modern tools, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Deliver Training:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and facilitate engaging, practical training programs, onboarding sessions, and workshops for BDs, AEs, and AMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Strong Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with US GTM leaders to understand their team’s skill gaps, top challenges, and daily workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create &amp;amp; Curriculum Develop:&lt;/strong&gt; Build clear, actionable enablement assets, playbooks, and learning modules that sales reps will actually use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product Marketing, Sales Operations, and Global Enablement to translate product updates and GTM strategies into frontline training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Tool &amp;amp; AI Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Help teams integrate modern sales tools and AI capabilities smoothly into their day-to-day routines to make them more effective (not more bogged down).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; in Revenue/Sales Enablement, Sales Training, or GTM Leadership within a B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitation &amp;amp; Training Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of designing curriculum and delivering live, interactive training sessions that drive real skill adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Builder:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding interpersonal skills with a natural ability to earn trust and buy-in from sales reps and revenue executives alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to break down complex products or sales methodologies into simple, compelling concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly organized, proactive self-starter who enjoys bringing ideas from concept to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
