&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We include transparent salary ranges to support fairness, clarity, and informed decision-making early in the process. The base salary range for this position is €70,000 - €90,000 gross annually for candidates based in Lisbon. Your actual salary will be determined based on your unique skills, experience, and competencies. If your expectations differ, please let us know - we’re always open to a conversation.&lt;/p&gt;
